  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Now let's convert that three -pointer idea into code.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 3220,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 97,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "We start with three pointers.",
      "start_ms": 4040,
      "end_ms": 5560,
      "start_frame": 121,
      "end_frame": 167,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Low is zero, mid is zero, and high is the last index.",
      "start_ms": 6180,
      "end_ms": 10940,
      "start_frame": 185,
      "end_frame": 328,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Now we continue, while mid is less than or equal to high.",
      "start_ms": 11720,
      "end_ms": 15800,
      "start_frame": 352,
      "end_frame": 474,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "At every step, we only check nums at mid.",
      "start_ms": 16340,
      "end_ms": 19360,
      "start_frame": 490,
      "end_frame": 581,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "If nums at mid is zero, we swap nums at low with nums at mid, then move low one step forward, and move mid one step forward.",
      "start_ms": 19860,
      "end_ms": 29820,
      "start_frame": 596,
      "end_frame": 895,
      "word_count": 27
    },
    {
      "text": "If nums at mid is one, there is nothing to swap.",
      "start_ms": 30480,
      "end_ms": 33760,
      "start_frame": 914,
      "end_frame": 1013,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "It already belongs in the middle region, so we only move mid forward.",
      "start_ms": 34360,
      "end_ms": 39000,
      "start_frame": 1031,
      "end_frame": 1170,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Otherwise, nums at mid must be two.",
      "start_ms": 39880,
      "end_ms": 42900,
      "start_frame": 1196,
      "end_frame": 1287,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "So we swap nums at mid with nums at high, then move high one step left.",
      "start_ms": 43520,
      "end_ms": 48960,
      "start_frame": 1306,
      "end_frame": 1469,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "And notice carefully, we do not move mid here.",
      "start_ms": 49920,
      "end_ms": 52980,
      "start_frame": 1498,
      "end_frame": 1589,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "That line is intentionally missing.",
      "start_ms": 53860,
      "end_ms": 55800,
      "start_frame": 1616,
      "end_frame": 1674,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Why?",
      "start_ms": 56440,
      "end_ms": 56840,
      "start_frame": 1693,
      "end_frame": 1705,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Because the value coming from high was still unknown.",
      "start_ms": 57220,
      "end_ms": 60960,
      "start_frame": 1717,
      "end_frame": 1829,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "We have to inspect it first.",
      "start_ms": 61820,
      "end_ms": 63540,
      "start_frame": 1855,
      "end_frame": 1906,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "The loop continues, until mid becomes greater than high.",
      "start_ms": 64120,
      "end_ms": 68380,
      "start_frame": 1924,
      "end_frame": 2051,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "At that point, the unknown region is empty, and the whole array is correctly partitioned.",
      "start_ms": 69100,
      "end_ms": 75900,
      "start_frame": 2073,
      "end_frame": 2277,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "So the complete logic is simple.",
      "start_ms": 75940,
      "end_ms": 78060,
      "start_frame": 2278,
      "end_frame": 2342,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Zero goes to the left, one stays in the middle, and two goes to the right.",
      "start_ms": 78880,
      "end_ms": 84860,
      "start_frame": 2366,
      "end_frame": 2546,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "The important part is not memorizing the code.",
      "start_ms": 85800,
      "end_ms": 88880,
      "start_frame": 2574,
      "end_frame": 2666,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "It is remembering what low, mid, and high guarantee at every step.",
      "start_ms": 89640,
      "end_ms": 96420,
      "start_frame": 2689,
      "end_frame": 2893,
      "word_count": 12
    }
  ],
